I'd be happy to help you get the w83627ehf module patched to support
your w83627dhg chip. Do please include lm-sensors at lm-sensors.org in
your email (I did it for you) so your question and my answer are
available in the list archives.

Start with this email I sent Feb 7, in the list archives:
http://lists.lm-sensors.org/pipermail/lm-sensors/2007-February/018830.html

You will need to snip it at the lines that say -------------- next
part --------------

It has two attachments: the patch and the full driver. It also links
to the original announcement of w83627dhg support I sent Dec 26 2006,
so please read that email also. I believe that's all you'll need to
get your kernel patched.

Hope that helps,
David

